      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Use Case:\nAs a Data Engineer, when I create a securable object (schema, catalog, function, table, view),\nhow can I assure that required security groups are applied\n\n--> Metadata Driven YAML files --> key:value \nSELECT: AAD-SELECT-TABLE-NAME\nUPDATE: AAD-UPDATE-TABLE-NAME\n\n\n\n\nCreating Clusters --> Databricks-CLI --> \n",
